1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,450
Has a leap second ever been taken away?

2
00:00:04,467 --> 00:00:12,204
The IERS table lists 28 values, climbing from 10
seconds to 37 seconds without ever going down.

3
00:00:12,533 --> 00:00:17,283
Every one of those steps added a
second; none has ever been taken away.
